# The build context is `public/` and `deploy/nginx.conf`, and nothing else.
#
# `.cache/` is the reason this file exists: it holds 90 MB of DB-IP exports
# after a local build, and without this every `docker build` would send them
# to the daemon to be ignored.
*
!public/
!deploy/nginx.conf

# `public/v1/index.json` and the shards are wanted; nothing else under it is.
public/**/*.partial
